@page "/components/attachment"

<PageTitle>Attachment — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Attachment</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A file attached to a message: its thumbnail, its name and size, and what you can do with it. shadcn ships it with the AI components; nothing about it is specific to a model, and the demo's file manager and chat blocks both use it.
</p>

<p class="doc-note">
    Message, Bubble, Attachment, Marker and the scroller. The scroller follows the newest message
    only while you are already at the bottom — scroll up to read something and it stops, which is
    the behaviour every chat needs and most get wrong in one direction or the other.
    <code>overflow-anchor</code> does that half in CSS; the browser has had it since 2018.
</p>
